tests:
  unit: { count: 75, covers: "the per-level check list and the three call sites that restate it: the epic list drops the four review checks and keeps the walk, the WU list is unchanged, the commit list carries design and no review, the printed checks: line is asserted literally per level, a deferring row borrows its target's levels and the target names its own so resolution cannot chain, a check a level can emit is one the table says that level runs, a standalone commit runs the same list as a seam because it lands code, an epic tip is ready to sign with no review note, and neither the signing order nor the notes-write message names a review the level does not owe" }
